From: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: mtk_eth_soc: harden probe unwind, reset
 remove, bind, and TX GSO bounds

Fix transactional netdev/MAC/ESW probe unwind, EEE and reset producer removal ordering, PPE common-cmd bind guards, and small-frag/GSO TX descriptor checks.
Signed-off-by: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
---
